      "body": "This one off paid opportunity is for both child (7-14years) and adults\nOverview\nWe are currently recruiting for a very urgent project collecting UK English speech for a global leader in speech and search technology services. With expertise in more than 150 languages. Our solutions help companies create engaging products with accurate speech interfaces and relevant content ranging from web sites, to maps, images, and merchandise.\nThe task will involve recording short English phrases from a WebApp using your own Android smart phone/tablet. You may also use your computer + microphone, but the preference is given to Android users. Recording the phrases will take approximately 2 hours.\ncontact me at Laog202 at aol dot com for more info",
